{"version":1,"content":"<p>早前美國四仔導演Harry Sparks宣布為去年推出嘅色情電影《Scissors》推出小說版，同時又宣布續集《Scissors: Chapter 2》已進入後期製作階段，預計喺今年內上映。</p><p>呢部電影集懸疑、色情及超自然元素，上集故事講述女主</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.267500+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:00:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"7f23b9b78ed7ff0b32f107b1e1f2fe87ad4e87f34acb6c45c66b2ed527ca7e2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}